    rdfs:label "Attention Is All You Need" ;
    mlkg:abstract "The dominant sequence transduction models are based on complex recurrent or convolutional neural networks. We propose a new simple network architecture, the Transformer, based solely on attention mechanisms, dispensing with recurrence and convolutions entirely."^^xsd:string ;
